# FOC v17.18o: faction-coloured Star Wars weapon visuals and sounds.
# Assets adapted from the uploaded Star Wars Weapons (common.zip) and SWFO sound pack;
# every identifier is prefixed foc_v1718o_ so other installed Star Wars mods cannot collide.

